   - `vdProfile_antitone`, `vdProfile_le` (monotonicity and the uniform bound ≤ n);
   - `vdProfile_mono_signal` (functoriality under depth-non-increasing coordinatewise maps);
   - the tropical sandwich `profile_combine_supertropical` (max ≤ profile of the sum signal, stated through the catalog's `tropicalization_base` so `add = max`) and `profile_combine_subadditive` (profile of the sum signal ≤ ordinary sum);
   - `profile_vdepth_sum_subadditive` — the catalog bridge for a real family of functions over a semiring, routed through `ValuationDepthMeasure.vdepth_sum_le`;
   - `vdProfile_sum_layercake` — layer-cake reconstruction `∑_{t<N} vdProfile d t = ∑ i, min (d i) N`;
   - the extensional criterion `induced_eq_of_profile_eq` / `profile_eq_of_induced_eq` for a bundled `InducedTropProfile` datum (catalog `TropicalValuationObject` on ℕ + the profile), plus `depth_sum_eq_of_profile_eq`.

